{"id":"torrey:arms-military","source":"torrey","name":"Arms, Military","slug":"arms-military","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Made of iron, steel, or brass — Job 20:24; 1Sa 17:5,6.","refs":[["Job",20,24,20,24],["1Sam",17,5,17,5],["1Sam",17,6,17,6]]},{"text":"Sword. — Jdj 20:15; Eze 32:27.","refs":[["Judg",20,15,20,15],["Ezek",32,27,32,27]]},{"text":"Two-edged sword. — Ps 149:6; Pr 5:4.","refs":[["Ps",149,6,149,6],["Prov",5,4,5,4]]},{"text":"Dagger. — Jdj 3:16,21,22.","refs":[["Judg",3,16,3,16],["Judg",3,21,3,21],["Judg",3,22,3,22]]},{"text":"Dart or javelin. — 1Sa 18:10,11; 2Sa 18:14.","refs":[["1Sam",18,10,18,10],["1Sam",18,11,18,11],["2Sam",18,14,18,14]]},{"text":"Spear or lance. — 1Sa 26:7; Jer 50:42.","refs":[["1Sam",26,7,26,7],["Jer",50,42,50,42]]},{"text":"Battle-axe. — Eze 26:9; Jer 51:20.","refs":[["Ezek",26,9,26,9],["Jer",51,20,51,20]]},{"text":"Bow and arrows. — Ge 48:22; 1Ki 22:34.","refs":[["Gen",48,22,48,22],["1Kgs",22,34,22,34]]},{"text":"Sling. — 1Sa 17:50; 2Ki 3:25.","refs":[["1Sam",17,50,17,50],["2Kgs",3,25,3,25]]},{"text":"Hand staff. — Mt 26:47.","refs":[["Matt",26,47,26,47]]},{"text":"Called weapons of war. — 2Sa 1:27.","refs":[["2Sam",1,27,1,27]]},{"text":"Called instruments of war. — 1Ch 12:33,37.","refs":[["1Chr",12,33,12,33],["1Chr",12,37,12,37]]},{"text":"Called instruments of death. — Ps 7:13.","refs":[["Ps",7,13,7,13]]},{"text":"Helmet. — 1Sa 17:5,38; 2Ch 26:14.","refs":[["1Sam",17,5,17,5],["1Sam",17,38,17,38],["2Chr",26,14,26,14]]},{"text":"Coat of mail, breastplate, habergeon, or brigandine. — 1Sa 17:5,38; Ex 28:32; Jer 46:4; Re 9:9.","refs":[["1Sam",17,5,17,5],["1Sam",17,38,17,38],["Exod",28,32,28,32],["Jer",46,4,46,4],["Rev",9,9,9,9]]},{"text":"Girdle. — 1Sa 18:4; 2Sa 18:11.","refs":[["1Sam",18,4,18,4],["2Sam",18,11,18,11]]},{"text":"Target. — 1Sa 17:6.","refs":[["1Sam",17,6,17,6]]},{"text":"Greaves. — 1Sa 17:6.","refs":[["1Sam",17,6,17,6]]},{"text":"Shield. — 1Ki 10:16,17; 14:26,27.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,16,10,16],["1Kgs",10,17,10,17],["1Kgs",14,26,14,26],["1Kgs",14,27,14,27]]},{"text":"Buckler. — 1Ch 5:18; Eze 26:8.","refs":[["1Chr",5,18,5,18],["Ezek",26,8,26,8]]},{"text":"Called harness. — 1Ki 22:34.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,34,22,34]]},{"text":"Called armour. — Lu 11:22.","refs":[["Luke",11,22,11,22]]},{"text":"Battering Rams. — 2Sa 20:15; Eze 4:2.","refs":[["2Sam",20,15,20,15],["Ezek",4,2,4,2]]},{"text":"Engines for casting stones, &c. — 2Ch 26:15.","refs":[["2Chr",26,15,26,15]]},{"text":"Not worn in ordinary times — 1Sa 21:8.","refs":[["1Sam",21,8,21,8]]},{"text":"Put on at the first alarm — Isa 8:9; Jer 46:3,4.","refs":[["Isa",8,9,8,9],["Jer",46,3,46,3],["Jer",46,4,46,4]]},{"text":"Armouries built for — 2Ki 20:13; Song 4:4.","refs":[["2Kgs",20,13,20,13],["Song",4,4,4,4]]},{"text":"Great stores of, prepared — 2Ch 32:5.","refs":[["2Chr",32,5,32,5]]},{"text":"By individuals themselves. — 1Ch 12:33,37.","refs":[["1Chr",12,33,12,33],["1Chr",12,37,12,37]]},{"text":"From the public arsenals. — 2Ch 11:12; 26:14.","refs":[["2Chr",11,12,11,12],["2Chr",26,14,26,14]]},{"text":"Often given as presents — 1Ki 10:25.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,25,10,25]]},{"text":"Tried and proved. — 1Sa 17:39.","refs":[["1Sam",17,39,17,39]]},{"text":"Burnished. — Jer 46:4; Eze 21:9-11,28.","refs":[["Jer",46,4,46,4],["Ezek",21,9,21,11],["Ezek",21,28,21,28]]},{"text":"Anointed. — Isa 21:5.","refs":[["Isa",21,5,21,5]]},{"text":"Part of, borne by armour-bearers — Jdj 9:54; 1Sa 14:1; 16:21.","refs":[["Judg",9,54,9,54],["1Sam",14,1,14,1],["1Sam",16,21,16,21]]},{"text":"Hung of the walls of cities — Eze 27:10,11.","refs":[["Ezek",27,10,27,10],["Ezek",27,11,27,11]]},{"text":"Taken off them. — 2Sa 2:21; Lu 11:22.","refs":[["2Sam",2,21,2,21],["Luke",11,22,11,22]]},{"text":"Sometimes kept as trophies. — 1Sa 17:54.","refs":[["1Sam",17,54,17,54]]},{"text":"Sometime burned. — Eze 39:9,10.","refs":[["Ezek",39,9,39,9],["Ezek",39,10,39,10]]},{"text":"Of conquered nations taken away to prevent rebellion — Jdj 5:8; 1Sa 13:19-22.","refs":[["Judg",5,8,5,8],["1Sam",13,19,13,22]]},{"text":"Inferior to wisdom — Ec 9:18.","refs":[["Eccl",9,18,9,18]]},{"text":"Spiritual armour. — Ro 13:12; 2Co 6:7; Eph 6:11-14; 1Th 5:8.","refs":[["Rom",13,12,13,12],["2Cor",6,7,6,7],["Eph",6,11,6,14],["1Thess",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"Spiritual weapons. — 2Co 10:4; Eph 6:17.","refs":[["2Cor",10,4,10,4],["Eph",6,17,6,17]]},{"text":"Judgments of God. — Isa 13:5; Jer 50:25.","refs":[["Isa",13,5,13,5],["Jer",50,25,50,25]]}],"refCount":87}
